       "Distance of the point P(x, y, z) from the origin O(0, 0, 0) is √(x² + y² + z²).",
       "Coordinates of the point dividing PQ internally in the ratio m:n are ((mx2+nx1)/(m+n), (my2+ny1)/(m+n), (mz2+nz1)/(m+n)).",
       "Midpoint coordinates: ((x1+x2)/2, (y1+y2)/2, (z1+z2)/2).",
       "The centroid of the triangle with vertices (x1,y1,z1), (x2,y2,z2), (x3,y3,z3) is ((x1+x2+x3)/3, (y1+y2+y3)/3, (z1+z2+z3)/3).",
