       "प्रथम सिद्धांत से अवकलज: f'(x) = lim(h→0) [f(x+h) − f(x)]/h।",
       "घात नियम: d/dx (x^n) = n·x^(n−1)।",
       "d/dx (sin x) = cos x; d/dx (cos x) = −sin x; d/dx (tan x) = sec²x।",
